WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
We didn't have much time to talk, like about 20 seconds.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.620
They were in retrospect.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.920
I'm glad I waited because this thing didn't work out too well.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.860
But we did talk.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.340
We had a good talk, and we agreed to meet next week,

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.140
if that's of interest.

